; Regression for nullary define-fun memoization: a 1500-deep chain of
; nullary defs (each body references the previous def and the base, so
; bodies are multi-reference like the wild CPAchecker files, but naive
; size stays linear so z3/cvc5 can seal the label).  The chain is longer
; than the old expansion bound (TR_MAX_DEF_DEPTH * 20 = 1280), so before
; translate-once-per-def this benchmark skipped as "macro expansion too
; deep"; memoized, references are lookups and no expansion ever happens.
